+        "invariant one enumerates and tests factor triangles."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: Section 3, Theorem 3(iii) gives an O(N^4) scalar (or O(N^3) "
+        "bit-parallel) central-triangle enumeration algorithm; at shipping it "
+        "used at most 1,273,143 word operations per instance and 0.362 seconds "
