+| G5 | exact shipping density `56,454 / 476,169,905,664 = 1.1856e-7`; reference total 0.222 s and 4,652,383 word ops over 8 |
+| G6 | five attacks, each 0/8; reference central-triangle scan 8/8 as Track B requires |
+| G7 | factor order 288 builds and verifies with the same six answer atoms |
+| G8 | 40 relabelling/order invariance checks, 20 carried-witness checks, 20/20 unrelated keys distinct |
+| G9(c) | 25 characters, conservative 25-token bound, 6 atoms, 284 intended-route word operations |
+
+## Oracle loop and G9 diagnostics
+
+The required `scripts/harden.py` run was attempted, but OpenRouter returned HTTP
+403 `Key limit exceeded (total limit)` before a single scored oracle response.
+The harness correctly treated all four retries as infrastructure errors rather
+than mathematical failures.  Consequently there is no hardness verdict yet, and
+the invalid error-only transcript must not be cited as evidence.
+
+| arm | solved / scored attempts | status |
+|---|---:|---|
+| bare | 0 / 0 | blocked by OpenRouter key limit |
+| structural hint | 0 / 0 | not run |
+| placebo hint | 0 / 0 | not run |
+
+`hinted - placebo` is therefore not measurable.  The structural hint has not yet
+been tested for causal help.  Re-run all three script-owned arms after restoring
